{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999290/extras/5b97ee2fc90dea5fd22e7190ae2294e6.poster.avif?t=1754055741\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999290/extras/5b97ee2fc90dea5fd22e7190ae2294e6.webm?t=1754055741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999290/extras/5b97ee2fc90dea5fd22e7190ae2294e6.mp4?t=1754055741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reduce, reuse and recycle</h2>Have you ever wondered how much waste is recycled every day? Do you know how the process looks? Well, let\u2019s start from the beginning. Because at first, the litter has to be\u2026 SORTED!<br><br><strong>Become a professional waste sorter and make a difference in the world in this fast-paced arcade game</strong>. Take responsibility for the first and most crucial stage of recycling - sorting. Separate plastic from glass, paper from metal, and recyclable materials from non-reusable waste.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999290/extras/b82955d028854f09fb2109f3ac823138.poster.avif?t=1754055741\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999290/extras/b82955d028854f09fb2109f3ac823138.webm?t=1754055741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999290/extras/b82955d028854f09fb2109f3ac823138.mp4?t=1754055741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep calm and find valuables</h2>Recycling is not a one-time deal gig. You need to watch the sorting belt carefully to avoid missing any recyclable materials. <strong>Plastic, glass, paper, metal - it\u2019s all mixed up there. In different forms, different shapes, and different colors</strong>. Bottles, newspapers, plastic packages, cans, paper bags\u2026 and it\u2019s all just the tip of the iceberg. You can also <strong>find various valuables that someone threw away, starting from money and jewelry, to finishing with unique collectibles</strong>. So put waste in the right place and start the machine of change that you want to see in the world.<br><br>Don\u2019t be fooled, though. It won\u2019t be enough to \u201cjust\u201d sort them out to proper bins.<br>Because <strong>SORTED! puts you up to the challenge</strong>\u2026 <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999290/extras/fd09a7c6ab307bb422ccbb951717b109.poster.avif?t=1754055741\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999290/extras/fd09a7c6ab307bb422ccbb951717b109.webm?t=1754055741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999290/extras/fd09a7c6ab307bb422ccbb951717b109.mp4?t=1754055741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sort together and catch the pace</h2>Enjoy <strong>the cooperative experience with local multiplayer</strong>! <strong>Break the record</strong> by throwing litter into proper bins and hitting combo! Feel the rhythm while the sorting belt keeps speeding up more and more! Optimize your flow! Find a way to be the most efficient and earn points for each correct match. <strong>Become the best of all sorters while having fun with friends</strong>.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1999290?t=1754055741","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754055741","caps